        "text_k3Bh9E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When feeding a group under the twilight, we love a layered main that captures the full complexity of the season. In this featured recipe, sweet, charred peaches pair effortlessly with the rich, savory depth of shoyu-glazed Ora King Salmon. Creamy burrata adds a cooling richness, toasted pistachios bring an essential crunch, and fresh mint leaves a crisp, herbaceous finish. It is bold, sweet, and designed to be shared.</p>",
